      "id": "KA-C87-really",
      "sequence": 3240,
      "title": "ನಿಜವಾಗಲೂ (nijavāgalū) — really?",
      "headword": "ನಿಜವಾಗಲೂ",
      "romanization": "nijavāgalū",
      "gloss": "really?",
      "script": "kannada",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:0dec2a5a9dbfd4a2",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for I didn't hear, then the Kannada for I didn't understand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ನಿಜವಾಗಲೂ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಜವಾಗಲೂ? (nijavāgalū?) — \"really?\", built on ನಿಜ (nija), \"true\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said with rising voice it is surprise; said flat, it is \"truly\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಜವಾಗಲೂ (nijavāgalū) is nija, \"true\", from Sanskrit nija, \"innate, one's own\" (CDIAL 7181), with forms of the native āgu, \"to become\" (DEDR 333), and -ū, \"even\": \"even truly?\" DEDR 333 compares Sanskrit ām."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "True, turned into a question."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "nijavāgalū",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nijavāgalū*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "nijavāgalū, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nijavāgalū*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "say nijavāgalū?",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: say *nijavāgalū?*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say the Kannada for I didn't hear, then the Kannada for I didn't understand, then say nijavāgalū again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Kannada for I didn't hear, then the Kannada for I didn't understand, then say *nijavāgalū* again]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does ನಿಜವಾಗಲೂ (nijavāgalū) mean? (\"Really?\".) Say it once more."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
